  q(HIST,'Clifford Beers, author of A Mind That Found Itself, helped start which movement?','The mental hygiene movement',['The temperance movement','The eugenics movement','The asylum building boom'],'B','Beers wrote about his own hospitalization and helped found what became Mental Health America.',NAMI)
